## INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS - KEY DIMENSIONS

### Diagram: INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS - KEY DIMENSIONS
![INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS - KEY DIMENSIONS](https://pub-cfb8b9095d7d4914990dbb6f73afeb92.r2.dev/general/frameworks/images/ir_key_dimensions.png)

### Framework Breakdown
- **1. Diplomatic Relations**: Visits, strategic dialogue, multilateral coordination
- **2. Defence**: Exercises, agreements, counter-terror, intel sharing
- **3. Economy**: Trade, FDI, FTAs, economic forums
- **4. Energy**: Oil/gas, renewables, nuclear, critical minerals
- **5. Sci & Tech**: Space, digital, AI, R&D, biotech
- **6. P-2-P (People-to-People)**: Diaspora, student exchange, tourism, cultural exchange
- **7. Strategic / Geopolitical**: Indo-Pacific cooperation, shared concerns, regional power balancing
- **8. Multilateral Cooperation**: UN, WTO, BRICS, BIMSTEC, etc.
- **9. Aid**: Budgetary support, infrastructure development, capacity building
- **10. Migration / Consular Issues**: Visa, extradition, illegal immigration, consular matters

